This plugin is original code. It does not copy other DSH plugins.

Official contracts used (DeepSeek Harness / Cordis):

- Bundle manifest: package.json `dsh.bundle.patch` → `cordis.patch.yml`
- Patch row: unique `id` + npm `name` (plugin insert, no @deepseek-ai override)
- Host: `export const name` / `export const inject` / `export function apply`
- Client: `dsh.client` + public slots (`sidebar.footer.action`, `shell.overlay`,
  `conversation.chat.node`)
- Archive set: workspace domain `archivedSessionIds` (unarchive restores the
  existing workspace `sessionIds` slot; official archive never removes it)
- Branch conversation: public `sessions.fork` then `prompt` (append-only log)

The following MIT projects were read as design references. Ideas only; their
copyright remains with their authors:

- cokiscarazo-rgb/dsh-session-management
